<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="page-header">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Our school</span>
    <h1>Rooted in care.<br />Open to possibility.</h1>
  </div>
  <p>
    Kaloboyei School serves refugee and host-community families in Turkana
    County with learning, dignity and hope at the centre.
  </p>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="content-narrow prose">
    <span class="kicker">The reason we are here</span>
    <h2>A school shaped by its community.</h2>
    <p>
      Kalobeyei Settlement is home to families from many places, each carrying
      knowledge, stories and dreams for their children. Kaloboyei School was
      created to make high-quality education feel possible and close to home.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our classrooms are places where learners can catch up, stretch further and
      find their voice. Teachers work alongside families and community partners
      to make sure children are known, supported and prepared for what comes
      next.
    </p>
    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <p>
      Every learner can grow. Belonging makes learning stronger. Practical
      skills matter. And a good education should open doors for the whole
      community, not only for one child.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="stats">
  <div class="stat">
